        "height": "190",
        "name": "ROUNDED_RECTANGLE"
      },
      "text": "STAGE 4 — MEASURE, DOSE THE EXERCISE, RE-TEST\nEvery patient comes here from their exercise group. Everyone gets the same short core battery; the diagnosis adds one module; irritability sets the starting dose; the Örebro score sets HOW the programme is delivered."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "rWECNSFkKrOGuJkRPvsQdP:1:7235",
      "type": "shape-with-text",
      "attributes": {
        "id": "1:7235",
        "x": "820",
        "y": "460",
        "width": "560",
        "height": "197",
        "name": "ROUNDED_RECTANGLE"
      },
      "text": "NS4-1 · How irritable is the neck?\nASK: “Tell me about your last bad flare. What sets the pain off, and how long does it take to settle?” Ask about the last 24 hours, sleep and headaches too."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "rWECNSFkKrOGuJkRPvsQdP:1:8330",
      "type": "connector",
      "attributes": {
        "id": "1:8330",
        "x": "1100",
        "y": "356",
        "connectorStart": "1:7231",
        "connectorStartCap": "NONE",
        "connectorEnd": "1:7235",
        "connectorEndCap": "ARROW_LINES"
      },
      "text": "NS4&gt;NS4-1"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "rWECNSFkKrOGuJkRPvsQdP:1:7239",
      "type": "shape-with-text",
      "attributes": {
        "id": "1:7239",
        "x": "460",
        "y": "767",
        "width": "380",
        "height": "165",
        "name": "ROUNDED_RECTANGLE"
      },
      "text": "HIGH: pain at rest or wakes you; small movements flare it; takes hours or until the next day to settle"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "rWECNSFkKrOGuJkRPvsQdP:1:8334",
      "type": "connector",
      "attributes": {
