      },
      "text": "RE-CHECK BEFORE CONTINUING\nRe-run the Stage 1 safety screen; repeat the arm-nerve check (NT3) and headache screen; re-score the Örebro and yellow flags; physio video exam; doctor review if arm symptoms aren’t improving by 6–12 weeks."
    },
